{"id":"28cb695aaa176c37","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions.md","title":"Theorem — 子层量词的伴随与 Frobenius 等式","display":"Theorem — 子层量词的伴随与 Frobenius 等式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions","aliases":["14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions"],"display":"Theorem — 子层量词的伴随与 Frobenius 等式","source_ref":"III.8, pp.146–149; IV.9, pp.204–210","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 子层量词的伴随与 Frobenius 等式"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"III.8, pp.146–149; IV.9, pp.204–210"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8548b49e60e0239\" href=\"?note=d8548b49e60e0239\" title=\"14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers\">14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:E\\to F\">\\(f:E\\to F\\)</span> 为小站点上的层态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq E\">\\(A\\subseteq E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq F\">\\(B\\subseteq F\\)</span> 为子层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1},\\exists_f,\\forall_f\">\\(f^{-1},\\exists_f,\\forall_f\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8548b49e60e0239\" href=\"?note=d8548b49e60e0239\" title=\"14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers\">14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers</a> 的构造，子层次序为逐点包含，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 为逐点交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists_fA\\subseteq B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq f^{-1}B,\\qquad f^{-1}B\\subseteq A\\Longleftrightarrow B\\subseteq\\forall_fA.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists_fA\\subseteq B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq f^{-1}B,\\qquad f^{-1}B\\subseteq A\\Longleftrightarrow B\\subseteq\\forall_fA.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists_f(A\\wedge f^{-1}B)=(\\exists_fA)\\wedge B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists_f(A\\wedge f^{-1}B)=(\\exists_fA)\\wedge B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一伴随的向右方向把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A(C)\">\\(a\\in A(C)\\)</span> 送入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_Ca\">\\(f_Ca\\)</span>，其像条件的筛为最大筛；向左方向将局部见证送进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的局部封闭。第二伴随的向右方向对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in B(C)\">\\(y\\in B(C)\\)</span> 的每个限制和原像使用假设；向左方向取恒等箭头即可。Frobenius 的左到右包含立即成立；右到左时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in B(C)\">\\(y\\in B(C)\\)</span> 的每个限制仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 中，故局部见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自动落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}B\">\\(f^{-1}B\\)</span>，两边定义使用同一个覆盖筛。证明也覆盖空覆盖及初对象退化情形。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，III.8, pp.146–149; IV.9, pp.204–210。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers","status":"resolved","id":"d8548b49e60e0239","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers","status":"resolved","id":"d8548b49e60e0239","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:E\\to F$ 为小站点上的层态射，$A\\subseteq E$、$B\\subseteq F$ 为子层。$f^{-1},\\exists_f,\\forall_f$ 为 [[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]] 的构造，子层次序为逐点包含，$\\wedge$ 为逐点交。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:E\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1},\\exists_f,\\forall_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_fA\\subseteq B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq f^{-1}B,\\qquad f^{-1}B\\subseteq A\\Longleftrightarrow B\\subseteq\\forall_fA.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists_f(A\\wedge f^{-1}B)=(\\exists_fA)\\wedge B.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\in A(C)","display":false},{"tex":"f_Ca","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in B(C)","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in B(C)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}B","display":false}],"bytes":1776,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions|thm-204 — 子层量词的伴随与 Frobenius 等式]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subsheaf-quantifier-adjunctions|thm-204 — 子层量词的伴随与 Frobenius 等式]]"}],"outgoing":["d8548b49e60e0239"]}